WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.938
Welcome to Episode 3 of the Start series
from the Federal Modernization Workbook.

2
00:00:04.938 --> 00:00:06.929
Episode 2 ended at gate G zero,

3
00:00:06.929 --> 00:00:11.326
with the estate inventoried and
the plans about to be generated.

4
00:00:11.326 --> 00:00:13.863
Now the work reaches the live environment.

5
00:00:13.863 --> 00:00:18.795
Over roughly four weeks, Phase one puts
the identity building blocks in place:

6
00:00:18.795 --> 00:00:23.496
groups and scoped administration, a
sign-in baseline, emergency accounts,

7
00:00:23.496 --> 00:00:28.813
the first HR feed, address management, and
the first servers under cloud management.

8
00:00:28.813 --> 00:00:31.450
Then gate G one checks
all of it from data.

9
00:00:31.450 --> 00:00:33.140
Let's see how the pieces fit.
